  "2026-09-10T04:44:03.610Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: all-status keyword searches for jscpd 5.2.0 and MCP Apps 2.0.0 returned zero matches; ext-apps history identified completed MCP Apps implementation pm-pznhee and resolved Hono/qs advisory owners. Live open and in-progress inventories checked; only the three active namespace tasks are claimed. Registry engines allow the supported Node floor: jscpd >=18 and ext-apps >=20. ext-apps is consumed only through type imports in src/sdk/mcp/apps.ts; official v2 peer changes require type and MCP runtime conformance checks before adoption."
  "2026-09-10T04:56:41.235Z","harness:codex","Dependency evidence: jscpd 5.2.0 and MCP Apps 2.0.0 installed reproducibly. Full four-project TypeScript checking passed; all three duplicate-scanner configurations passed with zero clones. MCP Apps v2 replaces the development-only SDK v1 peer tree with client/core v2 and removes 68 old package installations. Runtime protocol behavior remains subject to the linked MCP and full-suite gates."
  "2026-09-10T05:37:57.973Z","harness:codex","Live reliability and acceptance evidence: required Sentry/telemetry gate passes with zero critical/high/current Sentry issues, 1.96 percent telemetry finish error rate, and zero failures missing error codes. npm latest remains 2026.9.9; the latest completed scheduled auto-release succeeded. Current workflow schedules 02:35 UTC, serializes auto-release runs, and reuses an existing same-day UTC tag for automatic recovery. Candidate tarball installs and runs successfully via npm/Bun and npx/bunx."
  "2026-09-10T06:18:03.362Z","harness:codex","Final verification: 660 test files and 8680 tests pass. Exact coverage is statements 63924/63924, branches 48623/48623, functions 13290/13290, lines 61268/61268. Source/export/member docstrings are 100 percent. TypeScript, ESLint, zero-clone jscpd, static structure, SDK/command/flag parity, refusal recovery, token budgets, graph composition, record integrity, credential scan, and linked tests passed. Manual temporary-project acceptance and packed npm/Bun/npx/bunx consumers passed. The independent public verifier confirms published 2026.9.9; this implementation is pending PR review and merge. GitHub currently has zero open PRs/issues and zero open dependency/code/secret alerts."
